{
    "title": "Evidation - Rewards for Health",
    "description": "Earn points for health actions, like walking, sleeping, and more. \r\n\r\nHow it works\r\n- Complete cards: Answer questions, take surveys & read articles.\r\n- Track health activity: Connect health apps such as Fitbit & Apple Health.\r\n\r\nWhat you get\r\n- Health trends & insights: Make sense of your data\u2014from step count to sleep patterns.\r\n- Points redeemable for cash: Cash out or donate $10 for every 10,000 points.\r\n- Research opportunities: If eligible, receive invites to participate in health programs or research studies.\r\n- Personalized content: Receive health tips, articles & more.\r\n\r\nOur data practices\r\n- We\u2019re committed to trust & transparency at all times.\r\n- We do not & will not sell your personal information.\r\n- Your health data is shared only with your consent or at your request.\r\n\r\nReady to become an Evidation Member? \r\n\r\nJoin almost five million members reaching their goals and getting paid for health actions. \r\n\r\nReach your health goals and securely participate in cutting-edge research with the Evidation app! From receiving relevant articles and personalized insights to earning cash for healthy actions, the app makes it easier than ever to stay motivated.\r\n\r\n\"My sister told me about it, and it seemed too good to be true at first. But when she said that she had already received $20, I signed up. It was so easy and a monetary motivation really encouraged me to get up and get moving.\"- Estella\r\n\r\n\u201cI have had back problems for many years. Walking is one of the only ways I keep my back problems under control since the more you move the looser your back becomes and helps blood flow to heal your back. When I have the benefit of making money from keeping myself healthy, I go just a little longer each day.\" --Kelli C\r\n\r\n\u201d...Evidation Health helps users integrate a variety of wearable trackers, but in addition to using quantitative data pulled from said trackers, they also posed more qualitative questions of their user base for the purposes of this research. \u201c --Brit & Co\r\n\r\nWe pay you to:\r\n- Track steps\r\n- Log food\r\n- Log meditation sessions\r\n- Log sleep\r\n- Log miles biked\r\n- Answer surveys \r\n- Read health related tips and content\r\n- Participate in health programs\r\n- Contribute to research\r\n\r\nELEVATE YOUR HEALTH JOURNEY: From heart health to flu monitoring, join unique programs designed to help you learn more about your health. Whether reading tips for disease prevention or answering questions about your daily habits and health conditions, your participation also earns you points redeemable for cash. \r\n\r\nCONNECT APPS AND EARN POINTS: With options to securely connect 20+ popular apps (including Samsung Health, Fitbit and Garmin), start earning points for daily healthy activities such as walking, meditating, logging meals, and answering questions about yourself.\r\n\r\nREDEEM YOUR POINTS FOR CASH OR CHARITIES: Earn $10 for every 10,000 points, redeemable via PayPal, direct deposit, gift card, or by donating your points directly to charity.  \r\n\r\nPARTICIPATE IN CUTTING EDGE RESEARCH: Use the app as one-stop shop to find, match with, and opt in to health studies and contribute to findings published in top medical journals for the benefit of all. In exchange, you\u2019ll receive personalized insights to give you a deeper understanding of your health.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Earn points for health actions, like walking, sleeping, and more. <br><br>How it works<br>- Complete cards: Answer questions, take surveys &amp; read articles.<br>- Track health activity: Connect health apps such as Fitbit &amp; Apple Health.<br><br>What you get<br>- Health trends &amp; insights: Make sense of your data\u2014from step count to sleep patterns.<br>- Points redeemable for cash: Cash out or donate $10 for every 10,000 points.<br>- Research opportunities: If eligible, receive invites to participate in health programs or research studies.<br>- Personalized content: Receive health tips, articles &amp; more.<br><br>Our data practices<br>- We\u2019re committed to trust &amp; transparency at all times.<br>- We do not &amp; will not sell your personal information.<br>- Your health data is shared only with your consent or at your request.<br><br>Ready to become an Evidation Member? <br><br>Join almost five million members reaching their goals and getting paid for health actions. <br><br>Reach your health goals and securely participate in cutting-edge research with the Evidation app! From receiving relevant articles and personalized insights to earning cash for healthy actions, the app makes it easier than ever to stay motivated.<br><br>&quot;My sister told me about it, and it seemed too good to be true at first. But when she said that she had already received $20, I signed up. It was so easy and a monetary motivation really encouraged me to get up and get moving.&quot;- Estella<br><br>\u201cI have had back problems for many years. Walking is one of the only ways I keep my back problems under control since the more you move the looser your back becomes and helps blood flow to heal your back. When I have the benefit of making money from keeping myself healthy, I go just a little longer each day.&quot; --Kelli C<br><br>\u201d...Evidation Health helps users integrate a variety of wearable trackers, but in addition to using quantitative data pulled from said trackers, they also posed more qualitative questions of their user base for the purposes of this research. \u201c --Brit &amp; Co<br><br>We pay you to:<br>- Track steps<br>- Log food<br>- Log meditation sessions<br>- Log sleep<br>- Log miles biked<br>- Answer surveys <br>- Read health related tips and content<br>- Participate in health programs<br>- Contribute to research<br><br>ELEVATE YOUR HEALTH JOURNEY: From heart health to flu monitoring, join unique programs designed to help you learn more about your health. Whether reading tips for disease prevention or answering questions about your daily habits and health conditions, your participation also earns you points redeemable for cash. <br><br>CONNECT APPS AND EARN POINTS: With options to securely connect 20+ popular apps (including Samsung Health, Fitbit and Garmin), start earning points for daily healthy activities such as walking, meditating, logging meals, and answering questions about yourself.<br><br>REDEEM YOUR POINTS FOR CASH OR CHARITIES: Earn $10 for every 10,000 points, redeemable via PayPal, direct deposit, gift card, or by donating your points directly to charity.  <br><br>PARTICIPATE IN CUTTING EDGE RESEARCH: Use the app as one-stop shop to find, match with, and opt in to health studies and contribute to findings published in top medical journals for the benefit of all. In exchange, you\u2019ll receive personalized insights to give you a deeper understanding of your health.",
